{
  "id": "E229",
  "title": "Graduation Season",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2018-06-15",
  "synopsis": "What do Chinese students do during graduation season?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/760/45aa6a8bc80af7a96ca86675da137004103d00ad.mp3?1528361754",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "毕业季到了\n\n安妮：恭喜你通过毕业论文答辩！\n小刚：谢谢！终于可以松一口气了。\n安妮：接下来有什么安排吗？\n小刚：这周五我们要拍毕业照，我约了几个好朋友一起。\n安妮：我听说你们要一起去毕业旅行，你们打算去哪儿？\n小刚：对，我们准备毕业典礼结束后就一起去云南。\n安妮：真羡慕你们！",
    "traditional": "畢業季到了\n\n安妮：恭喜你通過畢業論文答辯！\n小剛：謝謝！終於可以鬆一口氣了。\n安妮：接下來有什麼安排嗎？\n小剛：這週五我們要拍畢業照，我約了幾個好朋友一起。\n安妮：我聽說你們要一起去畢業旅行，你們打算去哪兒？\n小剛：對，我們準備畢業典禮結束後就一起去雲南。\n安妮：真羨慕你們！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Graduation season is here"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "安妮：恭喜你通过毕业论文答辩！",
      "traditional": "安妮：恭喜你通過畢業論文答辯！",
      "pinyin": "ān nī gōng xǐ nǐ tōng guò bì yè lùn wén dá biàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Congratulations on passing the thesis oral defense!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小刚：谢谢！终于可以松一口气了。",
      "traditional": "小剛：謝謝！終於可以鬆一口氣了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo gāng xiè xie zhōng yú kě yǐ sōng yì kǒu qì le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Gang: Thanks! Finally I can breathe easier."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "安妮：接下来有什么安排吗？",
      "traditional": "安妮：接下來有什麼安排嗎？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī jiē xià lái yǒu shén me ān pái ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: What are you going to do next?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小刚：这周五我们要拍毕业照，我约了几个好朋友一起。",
      "traditional": "小剛：這週五我們要拍畢業照，我約了幾個好朋友一起。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo gāng zhè zhōu wǔ wǒ men yào pāi bì yè zhào wǒ yuē le jǐ ge hǎo péng you yì qǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Gang: We’ll take graduation photos this Friday. I asked some good friends to take photos together."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "安妮：我听说你们要一起去毕业旅行，你们打算去哪儿？",
      "traditional": "安妮：我聽說你們要一起去畢業旅行，你們打算去哪兒？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī wǒ tīng shuō nǐ men yào yì qǐ qù bì yè lǚ xíng nǐ men dǎ suàn qù nǎ'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: I heard you are going to have a graduation trip together. Where are you going?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小刚：对，我们准备毕业典礼结束后就一起去云南。",
      "traditional": "小剛：對，我們準備畢業典禮結束後就一起去雲南。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo gāng duì wǒ men zhǔn bèi bì yè diǎn lǐ jié shù hòu jiù yì qǐ qù yún nán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Gang: Yes, we’ll go to Yunnan together after the graduation ceremony."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "安妮：真羡慕你们！",
      "traditional": "安妮：真羨慕你們！",
      "pinyin": "ān nī zhēn xiàn mù nǐ men",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: I really envy you!"
    }
  ],
